  "description": "FANUC OPC UA integration SDK for .NET 9. Monitor robot and TP program status, read and write registers (R/PR), access system variables, and interact with digital I/O. Secure-by-default connections with explicit write permissions.",
  "id": "Robentex.Fanuc.OpcUa",
