  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.2.0: Adds same-type and mixed-type system-variable batch reads with shared session-local mapping caches and contiguous-range Reads. Robot status uses SNPX override and active-alarm sources to avoid mapping-invalidating UA Value reads. Adds controller-scoped read coordination, cached identity metadata, operation diagnostics, compact complete active-alarm message reads, and faulted-session handling after transport timeouts. Existing read/write entry points are retained. Read-only batch/status and controlled timeout/reconnect behavior were verified on a physical FANUC controller. Coordination is in-process; external clients can still invalidate mappings.",
